- [ ] Threat model (STRIDE) for app, API, probe pipeline; MASVS-L1 checklist (P9-01).
- [ ] TLS everywhere, certificate pinning with backup pins (optional), no cleartext (matches the observed `usesCleartextTraffic=false`).
